	Are you still using version 3.0i?  That's not the behavior I've
noticed in any subsequent versions.  In versions 3.0j and beyond, Wands of
Wonder can be charged one and only once.  IMHO, you should have wished for 2
blessed scrolls of charging first, and then wished for everything else.  When
the Wand ran out of charges the first time, recharge it with one of the
